{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56385","headline":"咏海潮诗 · 陈文弼","name":"咏海潮诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百谷朝宗处，朝昏汹涌时。\n未尝闻失信，不省与谁期。\n落势分江岛，来声震海涯。\n鱼龙争会合，鸥鹭竞相随。\n卷钓人眠待，贪程客恠迟。\n幸通蓬阏路，孤櫂去何疑。\n（见《吟窗杂录》卷二九《历代吟谱》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈文弼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56385.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56385","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}